  "contentHtml": "<p>지난주에&#160;현미경을&#160;이용해서&#160;금붕어&#160;꼬리지느러미를&#160;확대해&#160;</p><p>혈관과 혈관을 통해 흐르는 혈액을 관찰한 영상을 공유합니다.</p><p>영상을 보시면 적혈구 하나가 겨우 지나갈 수 있는 모세혈관도 보이네요.</p><p>혈액관련 수업 하실때 참고하셔도 좋을 것 같아요. 오늘 좋은하루 되세요.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PKHjmpnD_Ss\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PKHjmpnD_Ss</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PKHjmpnD_Ss\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/WLEZ1/hyTtnmdJkz/Eh0vP4slv6KDlK9l1nF761/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/PKHjmpnD_Ss\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
